Clio's dictionary, apps/clio/public/data/dictionary.json, is built from
CC-CEDICT, https://cc-cedict.org, (c) MDBG, licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/. It was changed: traditional
forms and some variant entries were removed, pinyin was converted to tone
marks and definitions were cut to 12 per reading. The snapshot is the one in
the npm package cedict-json 1.3.20251213 (13 Dec 2025), which is also CC
BY-SA 4.0; apps/clio/scripts/build-dictionary.mjs makes it.

Clio's HSK 3.0 word list, apps/clio/public/data/hsk.json, is built from
complete-hsk-vocabulary, https://github.com/drkameleon/complete-hsk-vocabulary
(commit 7ac65bf), copyright 2026 Yanis Zafiropulos, licensed under the MIT
licence. That project takes its HSK 3.0 words from hsk30,
https://github.com/elkmovie/hsk30, copyright (c) 2021 Pleco Inc., licensed
under the MIT licence, and its English glosses from CC-CEDICT (above).
apps/clio/scripts/build-hsk.mjs makes it.
